<title>COLOMBIA: TABLE - Corfinsura 1H net profits up 151 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Corfinsura 1H net profits up 151 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BOGOTA 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Colombia's largest insurance group Corfinsura, the financial arm of the powerful Sindicato Antioqueno conglomerate, posted the following first-half results:</p>
<p>    First half 1997			   First half 1996</p>
<p>Net profit 59.68 billion pesos	  profit 23.8 billion</p>
<p>Total assets 1.47 trillion		assets 1.16 trillion</p>
<p>Total loans portfolio 988.6 billion   loans 786.4 billion</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures in Colombian pesos and results subject to verification by Securities Superintendency.</p>
<p>((--Karl Penhaul, Bogota newsroom, 571 610 7944))</p>
</text>
